          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥራ ፡ አስረዳችኋለሁ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኢየአክሎ ፡ ዘይነብብ ፡ ንባበ ፡ እኩየ ፡ ላዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሌነ ፡ እስከ ፡ ኢይትዌከፎሙ ፡ ለአኀዊነ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንድሞቻችንን ፡ አትቀበሏቸው ፡ እስከ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማለት ፡ ድረስ ፡ ደርሶ ፡ በኛ ፡ ላይ ፡ የሚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናገረው ፡ ክፉ ፡ ነገር ፡ አልበቃው ፤ ብሏ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልና ፥ ይነብብን ፡ ሲያይ ፡ ንባበ ፡ እኩየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሏል ፡ እንጅ ፡ ንባብ ፡ እኩይ ፡ ቢል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይቀናል ። አንድም ፡ በኛ ፡ ላይ ፡ የሚናገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ረው ፡ ክፉ ፡ ነገር ፡ አልበቃው ፡ ብሎ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንድሞቻችንን ፡ አትቀበሏቸው ፡ እስከ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማለት ፡ ደርሰዋልና ። አንድም ፡ በኛ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላይ ፡ የሚናገረው ፡ ክፉ ፡ ነገር ፡ አልበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃው ፡ ብሏልና ፡ ወንድሞቻችንን ፡ አትቀ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሏቸው ፡ እስከ ፡ ማለት ፡ ደረሰ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወለእለኒ ፡ ይፈቅዱ ፡ ተቀብሎቶሙ ፡ ይከልእ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሊቀበሏቸው ፡ የሚወዱትንም ፡ እንዳይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀበሏቸው ፡ ይከለክላል ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወያወፅኦሙ ፡ ዓዲ ፡ እምቤተ ፡ ክርስቲያን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳግመኛም ፡ ከምእመናን ፡ ይለያቸዋል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐተታ ፡ ከባላገር ፡ እንዳይገቡ ፡ ባዋጅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከስዱዳን ፡ እንዳይገቡ ፡ በጐስጓሽ ፡ ያስወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣቸዋል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": "፲፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፩ ፤ ኦ ፡ እኀየ ፡ ኢትኩን ፡ ከመ ፡ ገባሬ ፡ እኪት ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንተም ፡ ወንድሜ ፡ እንደማናቸው ፡ ክ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፉ ፡ አድራጊ ፡ አትሁን ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪አላ ፡ ከመ ፡ ገባሬ ፡ ሠናይት ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ ማናቸው ፡ በጎ ፡ አድራጊ ፡ ሁን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንጅ ። አንድም ፡ እንደ ፡ ዲዮጥራጥስ ፡ አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትሁን ፡ እንደ ፡ ድሜጥሮስ ፡ ሁን ፡ እንጅ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ገባሬ ፡ ሠናይት ፡ እምእግዚአብሔር ፡ ውእቱ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጎ ፡ የሚሠራ ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የተወለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደ ፡ የተማረ ፡ ነውና ፥ አላ ፡ ከመ ፡ ገባሬ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሠናይት ፡ ላለው ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወገባሬ ፡ እኪትሰ ፡ ኢይሬእዮ ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክፉ ፡ የሚሠራ ፡ ግን ፡ እግዚአብሔርን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አያምነውም ፡ አያየውምና ፡ ኢትኩን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመ ፡ ገባሬ ፡ እኪት ፡ ላለው ፡ ፩ ፡ ዮሐ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፥ ፮ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፲፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፪ ፤ ወበእንተ ፡ ድሜጥሮስኒ ፡ ስምዐ ፡ ኮነ ፡ ኵሉ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለ ፡ ድሜጥሮስ ፡ ሰው ፡ ሁሉ ፡ መሰከረለት ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወለሊሃኒ ፡ ጽድቅ ፡ ስምዐ ፡ ኮነት ፡ ሎቱ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሃይማኖት ። አንድም ፡ ተአምራት ፡ ምጽ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋት ፡ መሰከረችለት ። ታሪክ ፡ ይህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰው ፡ ገንዘቡን ፡ ጨርሶ ፡ መጽውቶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዘመነ ፡ ረኃብ ፡ ድስት ፡ ሙሉ ፡ ወርቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አግኝቶ ፡ ራሱን ፡ ምእመናንን ፡ ረድቶ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በታል ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወንሕነኒ ፡ ስምዐ ፡ ኮነ ፡ ሎቱ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኛም ፡ መሰከርንለት ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወታአምሩ ፡ ከመ ፡ ርትዕት ፡ ይእቲ ፡ ስምዕነ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የናንት ፡ ምስክርነት ፡ ምን ፡ ይረባል ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምን ፡ ይጠቅማል ፡ ትሉኝ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የኛስ ፡ ምስክርነት ፡ ዕውነት ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆነች ፡ ታውቃላችሁ ፡ ዮሐ ፡ ፲፱ ፥ ፴፭ና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፩ ፥ ፳፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": "፲፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፫ ፤ ወብዙኀ ፡ ብየ ፡ ዘእጽሕፍ ፡ ለከ ፥⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የምጽፍልህ ፡ ብዙ ፡ ነበረኝ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪አላ ፡ ኢፈቀድኩ ፡ በማየ ፡ ሕመት ፡ ወበቀለም ፡ እጽ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕፍ ፡ ለከ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብርዕ ፡ ቀርጬ ፡ ቀለም ፡ በጥብጬ ፡ ልጽ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍልህ ፡ አልወደድሁምና ፡ ተውሁት ፡ እ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንጅ ፡ ፪ ፡ ዮሐ ፡ ቍ ፥ ፲፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
